OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for 250 homes and
OL,4,Asupermarket on golf course
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been advanced to build 250
OL,7,Fhomes and a supermarket on a golf
OL,8,Fcourse.
OL,10,FHertsmere borough councillors agreed to
OL,11,Fredevelop Bushey Golf and Country Club
OL,12,Fin Hertfordshire at a meeting on
OL,13,FWednesday.
OL,15,FAbout 60% of the site - which is owned
OL,16,Fby the council and has not been used as
OL,17,Fa golf course since 2018 - will be
OL,18,Fpublic open space after the
OL,19,Fredevelopment.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
