OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for 250 homes and
OL,4,Asupermarket on golf course
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council plans to contribute #3m
OL,7,Ftowards the cost of a community hub,
OL,8,Ffeaturing a supermarket, nursery,
OL,9,Fcommunity centre, arts centre and car
OL,10,Fpark.
